See `docs/rules/11-billing-and-quota.md` for the full rule text. Do not duplicate content here.

Key points: full charge on CLEAN, half charge on exhausted ladder, no charge on pre-enqueue rejection. Quota is a float in Redis, decremented atomically. Bachs webhooks are async/off the hot path; no matching Postgres account row = UNAUTHORIZED, never a default quota.
